    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様です。今のところ撮影は順調のようですが、\n困ったことがあればなんでも言ってくださいね。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000018:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02",
          "part_id": "1_5_014_02",
          "file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_014hid/scenario_1_5_014_02.json",
          "command_index": 18,
          "field_kind": "dialogue",
          "field_ordinal": 0
        },
        "source_hash": "sha256:c338fdee6f5c2809797b10cec358db774b07f9f83fe814dffec42f337e482e54"
      },
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_5_014_02",
        "source_file": "assets/resources/scenariodata/1_5_014hid/scenario_1_5_014_02.json",
        "command_start": 18,
        "command_end": 18
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ、大丈夫だ。むしろ本当にサバイバルすることに\nなっても、楽しめる自信がわいてきたぜ。",
      "text_ref": {
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02:1_5_014_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000",
        "source": {
          "scenario_id": "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_02",
